    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92113" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαισ-τήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smashing, hammering</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἱδρώς</span>
			<i>the blacksmith's</i> sweat or toil, ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκμοσι . . ῥ</span>.
				<i>hammered</i> upon the anvil, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.153
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>destructive, pernicious</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ.
				φάρμακα</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθλά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.803
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. φάρμακα
			θυμοῦ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				790
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.921
				</span></i>
			.</div>
